From 9b733a11510e1855a22557a17dc98299673e6d47 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anmoti <77442643+anmoti@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 09:49:32 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 4/9] backend/wayland: let the host draw named cursors

Add wlr_wl_output_set_cursor_name(), which sets the host's cursor through
cursor-shape-v1 so named cursors look exactly like the host's own.

Cursor buffers no longer rely on wp_viewport, which hosts may ignore for
cursor surfaces (Hyprland does): they are passed with an integer buffer
scale, and at fractional scales the host cursor is hidden so that wlroots
falls back to a software cursor.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012X41FaHDG1j8zRZcCfwo6r
